      "claim": "The spec's Out-of-scope section says the docs/agents/issue-tracker.md Conventions bullet 'gains two sentences' naming `covers:` and `positive_case:`. At this snapshot that hand edit has already landed, and it is in fact three sentences (\"Once `SA-0415` lands, a criterion declares each set under `covers:`, and each member names its driver.\" / \"A negative claim declares `positive_case:`.\" / \"Until then, load refuses either key.\"), not two. This is a minor miscount in prose the cell never touches (the file is `forbidden`, and the content itself is correct); it costs nothing to leave as is.",
